[{"id":"c65695d","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"e325e16","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"[elementor-template id=3639]"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"},{"id":"7ba215f","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='et et-hero et-hero-s'><picture><source media='(max-width:700px)' srcset='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-122137131-592426555f9b58f4c07ffd43-600x810.jpg'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-122137131-592426555f9b58f4c07ffd43.jpg' alt='' fetchpriority='high' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-122137131-592426555f9b58f4c07ffd43.jpg' onerror=etF(this)></picture><span class='et-arch-o'></span><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-crumb'><a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/'>Home</a> / <a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/destination/'>Tours</a> / Morocco North to South Explorer</div><span class='et-eye'>Grand tour · 10 days</span><h1>Morocco North to South Explorer</h1><p class='lead'>Journey from the Mediterranean coast to the Sahara Desert, exploring Morocco’s mountains, medinas, and Atlantic coastline with Epic Travel Morocco.</p><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn' href='#et-iti'>See the day-by-day plan <svg aria-hidden='true' width='16' height='16'><use href='#et-i-arrow'/></svg></a><a class='et-btn et-btn-w et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Morocco%20North%20to%20South%20Explorer%20(10%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><div class='et'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-facts'><div><b>10 days</b><span>9 nights</span></div><div><b>Tangier</b><span>starting point</span></div><div><b>Marrakech</b><span>end of the tour</span></div><div><b>Private</b><span>your own driver &amp; vehicle</span></div></div></div></div><section class='et et-sec' id='et-iti'><div class='et-wrap et-tour'><div><h3 style='font-size:20px'>Route</h3><div class='et-stops'><span>Tangier</span><span>Chefchaouen</span><span>Volubilis</span><span>Meknes</span><span>Fes</span><span>Midelt</span><span>Merzouga</span><span>Todra Gorge</span><span>Dades Valley</span><span>Ait Benhaddou</span><span>Marrakech</span><span>Essaouira</span></div><div class='et-iti-h'><div><span class='et-eye'>Itinerary</span><h2>Day by day</h2></div><button type='button' class='et-tog' data-o='0'>Open all days</button></div><div class='et-iti'><details class='et-day et-rv' open><summary><span class='et-node'>1</span><small>Day 1</small><b>Tangier · Chefchaouen</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Explore Tangier’s old quarter, café squares, Kasbah Museum, King’s Palace, and Hercules Caves. Drive through Rif Mountains, hike Akchour Waterfalls, and reach Chefchaouen. Visit Grand Mosque exterior, Kasbah, Ras El Ma Spring, and rooftop views at Hotel Atlas.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>2</span><small>Day 2</small><b>Chefchaouen · Volubilis · Meknes · Fes</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive to Volubilis Roman ruins, explore mosaics and merchant homes. Continue to Meknes: Bab Mansour Gate, Mausoleum of Moulay Ismail, and Royal Stables. Arrive in Fes for overnight in a Riad.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>3</span><small>Day 3</small><b>Fes – Exploring the Imperial City</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Guided walking tour of Fes El Bali: souks, Chouara Tannery, Al Attarine Madrasa, and Al-Karaouine University. Explore Mellah (Jewish quarter) and Fes El Jedid.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>4</span><small>Day 4</small><b>Middle Atlas · Erfoud · Merzouga</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive over Col du Zad and cedar forests of Middle Atlas. Lunch in Midelt (“apple city”), then Tizi N’Talremt pass to Ziz Valley and Erfoud. Camel ride into Erg Chebbi dunes, sunset views, dinner, and overnight in Bedouin tent.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>5</span><small>Day 5</small><b>Merzouga · Rissani Market · Toudgha Gorge</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Sunrise over dunes, optional sandboarding or ATV tour. Visit Khemliya village for traditional drumming. Stop at Rissani market, then explore Tinghir palm oases and Toudgha Gorge (300 m high cliffs). Overnight nearby.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>6</span><small>Day 6</small><b>Dades Valley · Ouarzazate · Aït Benhaddou Kasbah</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Travel Valley of a Thousand Kasbahs, stop at rose farms in Kelâat M’Gouna. Visit Ouarzazate’s studios and Cinema Museum. Arrive at UNESCO-listed Aït Benhaddou for exploration and dinner with valley views.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>7</span><small>Day 7</small><b>Tizi N’Tichka Pass over High Atlas · Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Ascend High Atlas via Tizi N’Tichka Pass, spot Mount Toubkal, visit Argan Oil Cooperative in Taddart. Descend to Marrakech and enjoy evening at Jamaa El-Fena square with musicians, performers, and food stalls.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>8</span><small>Day 8</small><b>Marrakech · Explore the Red City</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Half-day guided tour: Souks (spices, blacksmiths, dyers, slippers), Koutoubia Mosque, Ben Youssef Madrasa, Marrakech Museum of Moroccan Arts. Explore Kasbah area: Saadian Tombs, El Badi Palace, Bahia Palace, and Jewish quarter.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>9</span><small>Day 9</small><b>Marrakech · Essaouira</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive to Essaouira via argan tree forests, visit cooperative. Explore UNESCO medina, Skala de la Kasbah seafront ramparts, windswept beach, and enjoy fresh seafood.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>10</span><small>Day 10</small><b>Return to Marrakech · Departure</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Transfer to Marrakech or Casablanca Airport. Arrive 2–3 hours before flight. End of Morocco North to South Explorer Tour with Epic Travel Morocco.</p></div></details></div><div class='et-note'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-info'/></svg><div><b>Tailor-made:</b> Every itinerary can be adapted — start date, number of days, hotels and stops. Tell us your dates and we send you a detailed quote.</div></div></div><aside class='et-side'><div class='et-book'><div class='et-book-h et-dark'><h3>Book this tour</h3><p>Free quote within 24 hours — no payment to ask.</p></div><ul><li><span>Duration</span><b>10 days / 9 nights</b></li><li><span>Start</span><b>Tangier</b></li><li><span>End</span><b>Marrakech</b></li><li><span>Style</span><b>Grand tour</b></li><li><span>Type</span><b>Private tour</b></li></ul><div class='et-book-f'><a class='et-btn et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Morocco%20North%20to%20South%20Explorer%20(10%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a><a class='et-btn et-btn-o' href='mailto:epictravelmorocco@gmail.com?subject=Morocco%20North%20to%20South%20Explorer'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-mail'/></svg>Email us</a><a class='et-btn' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/contact-2/'>Send a request</a